          "content": "Quantity breaks and Buy X Get Y offers. For Buy 1 get 2 free: paid quantity 1, free items 2. For Buy 2 get 3 free: paid quantity 2, free items 3. Eligible Storelib offers supply the saving; otherwise configure a valid discount code. Without a matching offer or valid code, all units are charged at their regular price."
